{
  "name": "AI Email Triage Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Email Triage Workflow\nA customer email arrives, a local AI model (Ollama — free, runs on your machine, no API key) classifies it as Sales, Support, or Billing, and every decision is logged for visibility. No manual reading, no guessing.\n\n**Setup required before this works** (see README):\n1. Point \"Customer Email Received\" at a real mailbox (IMAP credentials).\n2. Point \"Local Model (Ollama)\" at your local Ollama credential.\n3. Create the \"Customer Emails\" Data Table and repoint the \"Log Email\" node at it.\n\n**Known limitation:** local models are not perfectly reliable at strict single-category classification — in testing, borderline emails occasionally matched more than one category. See README → 'Known limitations'.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "name": "Customer Email Received",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -560,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mailbox": "INBOX",
        "postProcessAction": "read",
        "downloadAttachments": false,
        "format": "simple",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_IMAP_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "IMAP account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a3",
      "name": "Classify Department",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.textClassifier",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputText": "=Subject: {{ $json.subject }}\n\n{{ $json.textPlain }}",
        "categories": {
          "categories": [
            {
              "category": "Sales",
              "description": "Questions about pricing, purchasing, product demos, or interest in buying."
            },
            {
              "category": "Support",
              "description": "Technical issues, bugs, how-to help, or trouble using the product."
            },
            {
              "category": "Billing",
              "description": "Questions about invoices, payments, refunds, subscription charges, or account billing."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallback": "other"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4",
      "name": "Local Model (Ollama)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "llama3.1:8b",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "ollamaApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_OLLAMA_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Ollama account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b0",
      "name": "Tag: Sales",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        40,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dep0",
              "name": "department",
              "value": "Sales",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "name": "Tag: Support",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        40,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dep1",
              "name": "department",
              "value": "Support",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "name": "Tag: Billing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        40,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dep2",
              "name": "department",
              "value": "Billing",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "name": "Tag: Other",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        40,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dep3",
              "name": "department",
              "value": "Other / Needs Manual Review",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "name": "Log Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        320,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "insert",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_DATA_TABLE_ID"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "from": "={{ $json.from }}",
            "subject": "={{ $json.subject }}",
            "department": "={{ $json.error ? 'Unclassified (AI parse error)' : $json.department }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "from",
              "displayName": "from",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "subject",
              "displayName": "subject",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "department",
              "displayName": "department",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "removed": false
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": true
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1",
      "name": "Extend here",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Extend here\nAfter \"Log Email\", branch further per department: forward the email (Send Email node), post to that team's Slack/Teams channel, or create a ticket in your helpdesk tool. Left as a log-only step so this runs with minimal setup.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 280,
        "color": 5
      }
    }
  ],
